I’m going to add a specialized fused `dim=384, hidden=128` projection kernel. It will compute input layernorm and the five projections in one Triton pass, writing only `left`, `right`, and `out_gate`, which removes the large normalized-input and 5-projection intermediates from the 384-channel cases.
